arguments.rationale:
The config sets eval_subset_fraction=0.7, which causes validation accuracy to be reported only on the 70% most-confident samples, inflating metric_visible_val_acc to ~0.94 when the true accuracy is likely ~0.86 (in healthy range). This is a metric visibility bias fault.</anionale>
